  "accepted_answers": [
    "28 September 1981",
    "28 September 2015"
  ],
  "explanation": "The question asks when the *Danger Mouse* TV series was released. From the original sources, there are two distinct referents:\n\n1. **Original 1981 series**: Multiple documents (D1S4, D2S5, D3S2) state that the original *Danger Mouse* TV series began on **28 September 1981**.\n2. **2015 reboot**: Document D5S3 and others confirm that a reboot of the series began on **28 September 2015**.\n\nThe conflicting date **1 April 1975** (from D4S5) appears to be an error or unrelated to the main *Danger Mouse* series and is not supported by any other source. Therefore, it is excluded."
}
